WEBVTT

00:02.890 --> 00:06.650
Priestess of the Sky, who stole what is precious to me…

00:07.050 --> 00:09.580
If I don’t make her taste the same pain…

00:09.580 --> 00:10.320
Kojima!

00:11.290 --> 00:13.420
Stop!

00:31.210 --> 00:33.760
kimi to ireba

00:31.210 --> 00:33.760
If I’m with you -

00:33.760 --> 00:36.590
kimi to itara

00:33.760 --> 00:36.590
because I’m with you -

00:36.590 --> 00:41.220
kokoro ga yasuraku

00:36.590 --> 00:41.220
my heart is at ease.

00:42.180 --> 00:44.770
kimi mo soude

00:42.180 --> 00:44.770
Surely, you’re the same.

00:44.770 --> 00:50.320
kimi mo ima yasurakerute

00:44.770 --> 00:50.320
You’re at ease now, too.

00:51.360 --> 00:57.950
itekuretara ii noni

00:51.360 --> 00:57.950
If you can just admit it,

00:59.700 --> 01:03.290
sono mama

00:59.700 --> 01:03.290
for even time to forget us,

01:04.250 --> 01:17.430
jikan saemo wasuresouna kurai shizen dakara

01:04.250 --> 01:17.430
it’s only natural, at this rate.

01:18.180 --> 01:28.900
yubisaki kara koboreochiru violet wo yo

01:18.180 --> 01:28.900
Violet drops, falling slowly from our fingertips…

01:28.900 --> 01:35.780
chiisana yume egaite yukou

01:28.900 --> 01:35.780
“Let us follow that small dream with a smile!”

01:35.780 --> 01:41.700
futaride sasayaka na

01:35.780 --> 01:41.700
And just like that, we are happy

01:43.120 --> 01:47.330
kotoba ga ureshii

01:43.120 --> 01:47.330
over such trifling words

01:47.830 --> 01:52.040
somatteku sora

01:47.830 --> 01:52.040
that paint the sky.

02:08.730 --> 02:13.770
Silent Heart

02:10.600 --> 02:13.440
Stop it! Kojima doesn’t have anything to do with this, right?

02:13.440 --> 02:16.030
Yeah, you’re the main problem here, Priestess of the Sky.

02:16.490 --> 02:18.200
It’s all your fault.

02:19.450 --> 02:20.490
My fault?

02:23.080 --> 02:26.120
This all happened because of Kanon.

02:27.000 --> 02:30.460
If it weren’t for Kanon, this wouldn’t have happened.

02:31.500 --> 02:32.290
Urin?

02:33.790 --> 02:34.630
Urin, right?

02:36.710 --> 02:39.840
Urin, you can hear my voice, right?

02:41.720 --> 02:43.260
Open your eyes!

02:43.600 --> 02:46.180
Urin wouldn’t do such cruel things!

02:46.600 --> 02:48.020
Let go of Kojima-san!

02:49.020 --> 02:50.020
Come back…

02:50.480 --> 02:51.480
Come back to my side!

02:52.480 --> 02:55.440
Go back to being the kind Urin I love!

02:56.100 --> 02:57.070
Please…

02:59.400 --> 03:00.400
I…

03:24.800 --> 03:25.260
What happened?

03:25.890 --> 03:26.600
The Sea is…

03:29.100 --> 03:29.730
Ow!

03:35.060 --> 03:35.730
Don’t tell me…

03:44.070 --> 03:44.570
Not good!

03:45.070 --> 03:47.540
Get away from it, Priestess of the Sea, Priestess of the Sky!

03:48.040 --> 03:49.870
Or you’ll be swallowed by the darkness!

03:49.870 --> 03:50.410
Okay!

03:54.000 --> 03:56.790
Onee-chan said she loves me…

03:57.460 --> 03:58.590
Does she mean it?

03:59.050 --> 04:02.630
Don’t let the light get to you, Priestess of the Darkness.

04:02.930 --> 04:07.970
Let your heart be filled with the darkness, void of the painful light.

04:09.430 --> 04:12.940
Use your heart of darkness to destroy the heart of light.

04:42.130 --> 04:43.010
Sam!

04:44.970 --> 04:45.890
What’s that?

05:33.720 --> 05:35.640
The Sea is being dyed red…

05:36.020 --> 05:37.600
What’s going on?

05:38.100 --> 05:44.490
I don’t know. I’m not sure, but it could be that Sedona has completely revived.

05:45.150 --> 05:45.740
Urin…

05:53.950 --> 05:57.160
Destroy the light…

05:57.160 --> 06:00.790
Erase all light in the world…

05:59.500 --> 06:02.840
All things in the sea are turning into Sedona’s underlings.

06:04.050 --> 06:06.110
What an incredible dark power!

06:10.460 --> 06:11.160
Marin.

06:11.910 --> 06:13.720
Nobody wished for this, and yet…

06:14.320 --> 06:16.850
Not our friends from the Sea, not Urin…

06:18.530 --> 06:20.360
What exactly is Sedona?

06:21.290 --> 06:23.480
Why does it do such things?

06:25.830 --> 06:28.150
Protectors of the Sea and the Sky…

06:32.630 --> 06:34.390
O great light,

06:37.250 --> 06:39.460
shine over the deep darkness!

07:08.970 --> 07:10.380
It’s amazing, but…

07:10.710 --> 07:14.980
The Priestess of the Sea has overexerted herself.

07:18.470 --> 07:19.410
Urin…

07:20.150 --> 07:21.640
I’ll definitely save you.

07:34.010 --> 07:34.940
You’re awake?

07:35.350 --> 07:37.000
Are you all right, Kojima-san?

07:38.470 --> 07:39.420
Sorry, Kojima.

07:40.350 --> 07:41.600
It’s all my fault.

07:42.980 --> 07:44.060
I…

07:43.560 --> 07:44.690
Enough.

07:46.470 --> 07:48.530
The truth is, you already knew everything.

07:49.750 --> 07:52.610
My feelings… You despised them and laughed at them.

07:52.610 --> 07:53.480
What?

07:55.090 --> 07:57.330
Deep in your heart, you’re laughing, right?

07:58.930 --> 08:00.230
Kojima?

08:00.230 --> 08:01.750
Kojima-san, what are…

08:01.750 --> 08:03.210
You’re laughing too, right?

08:04.370 --> 08:06.630
After listening to me, you have always been…

08:07.340 --> 08:10.210
I’ve had enough of this love thing!

08:11.280 --> 08:11.860
Wait!

08:12.440 --> 08:16.010
I… I… Actually, Kojima, I’ve always…

08:16.010 --> 08:18.190
I told you that I’ve had enough!

08:19.260 --> 08:21.310
I totally regret falling for you.

08:24.360 --> 08:25.620
Kojima-san…

08:25.620 --> 08:27.560
He’s caught in Sedona’s darkness.

08:27.950 --> 08:29.370
That’s why he said that.

08:30.690 --> 08:33.030
He didn’t mean it.

08:33.600 --> 08:36.550
Pure hearts are more easily taken into the darkness.

08:36.920 --> 08:38.740
Pay him no mind, Priestess of the Sky.

08:43.910 --> 08:45.710
What’s with this fog?

08:46.220 --> 08:48.720
It itches my heart, but…

08:50.680 --> 08:51.690
Suzuki!

08:54.240 --> 08:56.580
Hey, have you seen Kojima-kun?

08:57.010 --> 08:58.160
Like I’d tell you.

08:58.680 --> 08:58.680
Huh?

08:59.110 --> 09:00.910
I hate you, you know.

09:02.370 --> 09:03.880
Oh, is that so?

09:03.880 --> 09:05.940
But Suzuki is still Suzuki.

09:06.330 --> 09:07.650
I’m not the least bit disturbed by it.

09:08.410 --> 09:12.250
Your words just don’t have any impact to them…

09:12.910 --> 09:13.650
Shut up, bitch.

09:14.910 --> 09:16.070
Again with the common lines…

09:16.640 --> 09:19.780
You know that Kojima-kun actually hates you too, right?

09:19.780 --> 09:25.410
Hates you…

09:29.990 --> 09:32.280
It’s just Suzuki, anyway…

09:32.210 --> 09:34.210
Totally knocked down...

09:35.620 --> 09:38.180
It’s not like you have any experience being in love.

09:38.710 --> 09:41.270
What do you know, huh?

09:43.260 --> 09:44.300
Kojima-kun.

09:50.540 --> 09:51.310
Kojima-kun…

09:52.720 --> 09:55.310
I have something to tell you…

10:00.190 --> 10:01.060
Ooshima.

10:01.800 --> 10:04.160
Can you stop getting close to me for a while?

10:04.550 --> 10:06.130
Eh? Why?

10:07.210 --> 10:12.750
It seems Miyamori thinks we’re going out,

10:13.530 --> 10:16.020
so she’s gotten kind of weird lately.

10:18.070 --> 10:19.110
I’ll just be straight with you.

10:19.430 --> 10:20.930
You’re nothing but a bother, you know.

10:22.170 --> 10:23.180
A bother…

10:45.400 --> 10:47.220
Ah, jeez, shut up already!

10:47.220 --> 10:50.300
It’s because of you guys that I can’t sleep at night!

10:50.720 --> 10:54.060
Manjiro, it’s your damn fault that I’m not catching any fish today!

10:55.050 --> 10:57.380
Wha? What the hell are you doing?

11:07.500 --> 11:10.920
For now, let’s calm down and listen to what the turtle has to say.

11:11.410 --> 11:11.960
Okay…

11:12.960 --> 11:15.520
To defeat Sedona… How do we…

11:15.520 --> 11:17.040
Defeat Sedona?

11:20.880 --> 11:22.780
You’re not able to do something like that.

11:22.780 --> 11:23.590
Urin!

11:28.350 --> 11:29.280
Because it’s impossible.

11:34.780 --> 11:37.140
Since Onee-chan isn’t coming for me,

11:37.630 --> 11:39.380
I came for her instead.

11:39.770 --> 11:40.590
Urin…

11:41.140 --> 11:42.200
So, you’re all right…

11:42.200 --> 11:43.310
Marin, wait a minute.

11:43.730 --> 11:44.930
Why are you stopping me?

11:44.930 --> 11:46.640
Calm down and look carefully.

11:46.640 --> 11:48.780
It’s just as the Priestess of the Sky says.

11:49.310 --> 11:50.730
That’s not your little sister.

11:54.160 --> 11:58.550
Or maybe I should say she’s no longer your little sister.

11:59.300 --> 12:03.020
Light would never be able to defeat darkness.

12:03.840 --> 12:07.950
That’s why it’s better if Onee-chan comes over to this side.

12:09.160 --> 12:09.960
This is…

12:12.160 --> 12:14.640
I’ll protect Onee-chan,

12:15.810 --> 12:18.630
and I won’t lose to a heart of light.

12:19.740 --> 12:20.590
Urin.

12:21.900 --> 12:24.430
If only everyone’s heart was swallowed by the darkness…

12:25.090 --> 12:30.110
That way, there’d be no chance of light causing any suffering again.

12:32.090 --> 12:34.190
You really think so?

12:35.040 --> 12:38.150
Come on, Kanon said this before, right?

12:39.260 --> 12:41.930
“It’d be way better if the feeling of liking someone just disappeared!”

12:44.580 --> 12:49.030
Thanks to that dark heart, Sedona and I were awakened.

12:50.130 --> 12:52.460
That’s my ring.

12:53.490 --> 12:56.590
I granted Kanon’s wish.

12:57.000 --> 12:58.130
You can thank me later, okay?

13:00.150 --> 13:01.880
So, it’s my fault?

13:01.880 --> 13:03.770
Well then, let’s go, Onee-chan.

13:04.310 --> 13:06.340
It’d be better if we left this place for good.

13:06.340 --> 13:07.220
Wait!

13:07.690 --> 13:09.360
I love Urin!

13:09.750 --> 13:12.390
And I don’t want to lose that feeling!

13:12.390 --> 13:14.840
I’d never ever want that!

13:16.850 --> 13:18.310
So, please, don’t go…

13:19.350 --> 13:20.040
Please!

13:21.920 --> 13:24.570
So, you really aren’t coming after all.

13:25.740 --> 13:29.770
Maybe it’s because my dark powers aren’t enough.

13:32.820 --> 13:34.270
Urin, wait!

13:34.270 --> 13:35.160
Urin!

13:39.810 --> 13:43.050
It’s my fault?

13:43.050 --> 13:47.860
Neither of you are perfect as Priestesses yet,

13:47.860 --> 13:52.470
but it seems I have no choice but to teach you the way to seal Sedona.

13:53.300 --> 13:55.930
You girls okay with that?

14:02.910 --> 14:08.290
Sedona is a fearsome existence that changes all light to darkness,

14:09.730 --> 14:12.720
but Sedona doesn’t have a physical form.

14:13.300 --> 14:16.010
That’s why it can never be completely destroyed and has appeared many times.

14:16.630 --> 14:22.540
Each and every time, it’s sealed once more by Priestesses.

14:23.830 --> 14:27.060
This is the first time that Sedona has possessed a real form,

14:27.830 --> 14:30.280
but I believe the basic method remains the same.

14:31.170 --> 14:32.720
And that method is this:

14:34.060 --> 14:38.390
Use all your power to summon the Spears of Light, and with it,

14:38.390 --> 14:40.730
pierce through Sedona’s very core.

14:44.580 --> 14:46.580
Although it was quite unexpected this time,

14:47.080 --> 14:51.120
Sedona appeared and possessed your little sister.

14:52.220 --> 14:55.800
In other words, the responsibility of finishing it off rests completely on…

14:56.850 --> 14:57.680
I think you girls understand.

14:58.800 --> 15:00.010
I don’t understand.

15:00.470 --> 15:02.270
Are you telling us to… to kill…

15:02.840 --> 15:04.860
That is no longer your sister!

15:05.350 --> 15:07.870
Just accept that already! If you don’t,

15:07.870 --> 15:11.540
even your light will be swallowed by Sedona.

15:17.170 --> 15:19.840
Urin… What will happen to Urin?

15:20.920 --> 15:22.770
I don’t know,

15:23.540 --> 15:27.330
but it is possible that she’ll suffer the same end as Sedona.

15:28.360 --> 15:30.190
There’s no way we can do such a thing!

15:30.870 --> 15:34.660
If you can’t do it, the world will be covered by the darkness!

15:35.100 --> 15:37.470
There must be another way, right?

15:37.470 --> 15:38.750
Is anything else written there?

15:39.640 --> 15:42.180
This has never happened before.

15:42.730 --> 15:45.840
Urin… I have to…

15:46.810 --> 15:48.160
I can’t do that.

15:49.090 --> 15:52.880
Urin has never done anything bad.

15:55.390 --> 15:58.440
Urin’s just a little lonely…

16:00.710 --> 16:05.320
I should’ve noticed that earlier…

16:07.110 --> 16:12.740
Urin is my precious little sister, too…

16:15.610 --> 16:16.000
Marin…

16:16.770 --> 16:19.540
I’ll go to Urin.

16:20.090 --> 16:23.220
I’ll take her back from Sedona.

16:24.330 --> 16:26.500
Should I fail in doing that…

16:26.890 --> 16:28.520
Kanon-chan, you handle the rest.

16:29.220 --> 16:30.920
Handle… Handle what?

16:31.330 --> 16:33.080
Seal me, along with Urin.

16:33.480 --> 16:35.390
Huh? What are you saying?

16:35.390 --> 16:38.260
I could never let Urin suffer all alone!

16:38.570 --> 16:39.900
Calm down a little, Marin.

16:39.900 --> 16:41.020
I am calm!

16:41.040 --> 16:42.810
That’s how you’re calm?

16:42.810 --> 16:46.230
That’s enough! Let me go to Urin!

16:46.230 --> 16:47.520
Let me go!

16:47.150 --> 16:47.520
Marin!

16:49.280 --> 16:50.670
Pull yourself together!

16:52.670 --> 16:54.260
Please don’t say such a thing.

16:54.730 --> 16:58.740
Marin is my precious friend, too.

16:59.260 --> 17:01.190
There’s no way I can do such a thing!

17:02.140 --> 17:03.640
Kanon-chan…

17:10.500 --> 17:12.750
I want to save Urin…

17:14.770 --> 17:18.310
I know. There must be a way, somehow.

17:19.050 --> 17:20.780
We will save Urin.

17:24.930 --> 17:25.920
Thank you…

17:28.230 --> 17:31.730
If we combine our powers, anything is possible.

17:32.350 --> 17:34.490
That is a risky gamble.

17:37.630 --> 17:39.330
Everyone, follow me.

17:48.150 --> 17:49.900
Where are we going?

17:50.470 --> 17:54.270
When the people of this island experience pain and sadness,

17:54.770 --> 17:56.170
we go to that place.

17:57.260 --> 17:58.070
Eh?

18:08.100 --> 18:09.260
Ooshima…

18:19.160 --> 18:20.050
That is…

18:20.420 --> 18:22.930
Here we are. The pebble-dropping spot.

18:22.930 --> 18:29.610
Right where it brightens, we pray, as if it will erase our suffering.

18:29.620 --> 18:34.930
If we do so, our suffering will be cast out into the sea.

18:35.380 --> 18:36.720
Marin, you try it too.

18:43.840 --> 18:48.020
Please don’t let anyone else experience any more sadness.

18:49.200 --> 18:55.400
I wish the sadness that Marin, Urin and I feel would disappear so we can smile again.

19:11.440 --> 19:14.510
Kanon-chan must have experienced a lot of sad things.

19:15.520 --> 19:18.090
This is the first time I’ve come here.

19:21.590 --> 19:26.010
My sadness is nothing compared to this.

19:26.970 --> 19:35.650
But since long ago, the island residents discarded their sadness like this.

19:36.700 --> 19:39.880
We’re protected by both the sea and the island song.

19:41.120 --> 19:45.620
Urin was not protected by anyone.

19:47.290 --> 19:51.040
It’d be better if all the sadness were to disappear.

19:52.670 --> 19:55.410
A heart of light shuts out darkness.

19:56.940 --> 19:59.590
A heart of darkness begrudges light.

20:01.540 --> 20:06.100
The more radiant the light, the deeper darkness becomes.

20:07.510 --> 20:11.890
To remove their hearts of the darkness, people throw away

20:11.890 --> 20:13.730
all of their sadness into the sea.

20:16.480 --> 20:21.900
Those who do not know darkness are especially quick to succumb

20:23.610 --> 20:25.160
into the deep darkness.

20:27.980 --> 20:35.580
It’s painful, but this struggle between light and darkness was fated long ago.

20:36.990 --> 20:41.410
Don’t sway! Even so, we still have to fight!

20:41.410 --> 20:48.540
Yes. If we have the power of the Priestesses, we’ll definitely be able to save Urin.

21:02.650 --> 21:05.490
Have you memorized the chant for the Spears of Light?

21:05.490 --> 21:06.710
When it comes to it,

21:06.710 --> 21:09.230
you’ll have to take Sedona down together with your sister.

21:09.550 --> 21:11.570
There’s no room for hesitation. Got it?

21:12.290 --> 21:14.780
We will not hurt Urin.

21:15.470 --> 21:18.000
It’s okay if we separate Urin from Sedona, right?

21:28.880 --> 21:31.870
I’m worried, but it seems we just have to bet on it.

21:32.360 --> 21:34.430
In any case, do not let your guard down.

21:35.130 --> 21:35.790
Yes!

21:35.790 --> 21:36.630
Ichikawa?

21:38.090 --> 21:39.270
Where is she?

21:46.860 --> 21:48.260
My daughter…

21:48.260 --> 21:50.580
So, you’ve turned into that evil form once again.

21:51.220 --> 21:52.040
Ichikawa-san…

21:59.960 --> 22:01.940
Warin, Sam!

22:04.010 --> 22:06.210
Priestess of the Sea, Priestess of the Sky…

22:06.730 --> 22:10.180
Let us bring you to darkness.

22:26.820 --> 22:31.740
hikari no yurikago

22:26.820 --> 22:31.740
Within a droplet of water,

22:32.160 --> 22:35.290
shizuku no naka ni

22:32.160 --> 22:35.290
a cradle of light

22:35.620 --> 22:38.540
tojikometara

22:35.620 --> 22:38.540
is trapped.

22:38.540 --> 22:43.710
mizu no iro ni naru

22:38.540 --> 22:43.710
And so, it colors the water.

22:44.130 --> 22:47.340
mimi wo sumashite

22:44.130 --> 22:47.340
Clear your ears

22:47.340 --> 22:50.010
eien e

22:47.340 --> 22:49.930
to eternity.

22:50.010 --> 22:55.310
hitori de yume no ato

22:50.090 --> 22:55.310
Beyond a lonely dream,

22:55.310 --> 23:00.650
tsunaide yukeba

22:55.310 --> 23:00.650
if one connects with another,

23:01.350 --> 23:07.240
sotto kurikaesu kagayaki

23:01.350 --> 23:07.240
the repeating, soft shine

23:07.650 --> 23:12.280
warattemo attete

23:07.650 --> 23:12.280
meets and smiles,

23:12.280 --> 23:19.460
mou sukoshide kokoro ga todoku kara

23:12.280 --> 23:19.460
and with just a little more, the hearts have been reached.

23:19.460 --> 23:24.170
toumeina inori de

23:19.460 --> 23:24.040
With a transparent prayer,

23:24.170 --> 23:33.510
yasashiikuchikamu wo tsutsumuyo

23:24.170 --> 23:33.510
concealed within a gentle mouth.

23:35.550 --> 23:36.290
Did you know?

23:36.290 --> 23:38.380
The Blue-ringed Octopus doesn’t squirt ink!

23:38.380 --> 23:39.850
They use poisons instead.

23:39.850 --> 23:40.400
It’s Kanon.

23:40.400 --> 23:41.010
Who the heck?

23:41.010 --> 23:42.140
There is no antidote, either.

23:42.140 --> 23:43.100
That’s evil!

23:43.470 --> 23:47.080
Next time, episode 11: Heart of Light, Heart of Darkness.

23:45.020 --> 23:49.820
Heart of Light, Heart of Darkness

23:47.390 --> 23:49.820
I love everyone!
